UID:TSE197ok7yEJ8XopEgZis
SUMMARY:Free Watch Party: England vs Argentina
DTSTAMP:20260715T051910Z
DTSTART:20260715T133000Z
DESCRIPTION:Last night\, one team punched its ticket to the Final. Tonight\
	, the other spot is up for grabs. The tension is real\, the stakes are eve
	rything\, and we wouldn’t watch it anywhere else but here with you. \nKick
	off for this free event is at 2:00 p.m. \nFood and Beverage Concessions: C
	ool down with Frios Gourmet Pops. Non-alcoholic drinks from Coca-Cola as w
	ell as pre-packaged snacks can be purchased at the Community Partner Conce
	ssions Booth\, proceeds benefiting Levy Park and the event’s community par
	tners. You can also stop by the park’s full-time concessionaires: Kind Ice
	 Cream\, Hearsay\, and Gaspachos. \nActivities: Try your hand at our bubbl
	e stations\, groove to the music from DJ Athenz\, and enjoy coloring pages
	 from featured teams. \nMerchandise: Event merchandise celebrating Houston
	\, Levy Park\, and the global soccer tournament will also be available for
	 purchase. \nArt Installations and Photo Opportunities: Commemorate the ex
	perience with a photo tour of the park\, including life-sized soccer-theme
	d photo backdrops and a tournament bracket. Visit our soccer ball music bo
	x and turn the crank for festive sounds.\n\nhttps://www.levyparkhouston.or
	g/events/semifinals-2/\n\nFrom Levy Park Houston
URL:https://www.levyparkhouston.org/events/semifinals-2/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:levy-park-houston
CATEGORIES:Levy Park Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT4H
END:VEVENT
